  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "仕事なんだから……当たり前でしょ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim4": "mask_off",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ま、本当はアイドルなんて辞めて、\r\nあんたからも逃げようって思ってたけどさ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ……\r\nどうして、来てくれたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……ほんっとにデリカシーないわね、あんた\r\nまあいいわ、特別に教えてあげる",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……アイドルなんて、ちやほやされるためのもの……\r\nだから、それができないならもう興味ないって思った",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、辞めようって考えてから、\r\nなんていうのかな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "胸のあたりに、ぽっかり穴が空いたみたいな気分になったの",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それで……\r\nずっと家で、今までやった仕事のこと、思い出してた",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "どんな小さな仕事も……\r\n全部、すごく楽しかったなって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆは、さ。まぁ、今まで他人からどう見えるかを\r\nずーっと意識してたわけ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "どうやったらもっと可愛いって思ってくれるか\r\nもっとふゆをすごいって思ってもらえるかって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、アイドル始めてから……\r\n他人から評価されることより、仕事をするのが楽しかった",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "少しずつ仕事が大きくなっていって……\r\nちょっとずつ成長できてるって、実感みたいなのもあって",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もしかしたら……\r\nふゆもキラキラできるかもしれないって、期待しちゃった",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、本当のふゆは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "voiceKeep": true,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040150"
  },
  {
    "text": "…………っ",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子、無理に話す必要はないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……うっさい\r\nお願いだから……今は黙って聞いて",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆはね、\r\nほんとはいい子じゃないし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そんなの、\r\n隠そうとしても隠しきれるもんじゃない",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800104/1018001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001040190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "結局あんたにもバレちゃった訳だし\r\nじゃあいつもみたいに逃げようって",
